# TREND CAPTURE V2 — EXECUTION WIRING AUDIT

## CRITICAL FINDING: V2 NOT WIRED INTO BACKTEST

### Step 1 — Trace the Call Path

**Backtest execution flow:**

```
backtest() → calculateSignal(i) → [internal RSI/BB/regime logic] → signal → trade decision
```

**Key location**: `src/backtest/engine.js:71` — `calculateSignal(i)` function

**The Trend Capture V2 functions are never called:**

| Function | File | Status |
|---|---|---|
| `detectTrendCaptureSignal()` | `src/services/strategy.service.js` | NOT called by backtest |
| `evaluateTrendCaptureEntry()` | `src/services/strategy.service.js` | NOT called by backtest |
| `calculateSignal()` | `src/backtest/engine.js:71` | **IS called** — but uses simplified RSI logic |

**Exact call path in backtest engine** (`src/backtest/engine.js:71`):

```
calculateSignal(i)
  → closePrices array construction (normalized candles, indices 0→i)
  → rsiSeries(closePrices, rsiLen) [index i]
  → rsiMaSeries(closePrices, rsiLen) [index i]
  → bollinger(closePrices, bbLen, bbMult) [index i]
  → adxSeries(normalized, adxLen) [index adxLen-1]
  → emaSeries(closePrices, 20) [index i]
  → emaSeries(closePrices, 50) [index i]
  → regime determination (adx + bb width)
  → chop determination (EMA crossovers < 35)
  → rsiPassBull = rsi > 50 && rsi > rsiMa  ← SIMPLIFIED (no crossover)
  → rsiPassBear = rsi < 50 && rsi < rsiMa  ← SIMPLIFIED (no crossover)
  → priceAboveBasis = currentClose >= bbBasis
  → priceBelowBasis = currentClose <= bbBasis
  → priceTouchLower / priceTouchUpper
  → signal = LONG if rsiPassBull && (priceTouchLower || (priceAboveBasis && rsi > rsiMa))
  → signal = SHORT if rsiPassBear && (priceTouchUpper || (priceBelowBasis && rsi < rsiMa))
  → score calculation (RSI + BB + regime + trend - chop)
  → trade execution if no position && signal
```

**The Trend Capture V2 logic** from `strategy.service.js` is **completely bypassed**. The backtest engine has its own self-contained signal logic that predates the V2 addition.

